item.title:
[Bend] An approximately 33,193 gross square foot (GSF) building to be used for a Goodwill Industries donation site and retail store. The hours of operation are generally 10 AM – 6 PM, with frequent donation deliveries.   The proposed development includes:

• A 116-stall parking lot, including 4 accessible parking spaces, 2 being van accessible;
• Site landscaping;
• A pedestrian plaza;
• Water, sewer, and stormwater system connections;
• Loading facilities;
• Donation drive-through aisles

Site work has been submitted under SIMP permit application PRSIMP202403611 and infrastructure scope under permit application PRINF2024-03733.
TECH: LORI
